@startuml
title US-103 / US-104 - plugin load and first release (success and failure)
actor Validator as v
participant "GitHub (release-please)" as rp
participant "npm registry" as npm
participant "Claude Code" as cc
participant "warlog mcp (npx)" as mcp
rp -> rp: accumulate feat/fix commits -> Release PR 0.1.0
v -> rp: approve + merge Release PR
rp -> rp: tag v0.1.0 + GitHub Release; bump plugin.json / marketplace.json / .mcp.json
rp -> npm: npm publish --provenance --access public
alt Publish fails (permissions / provenance)
  npm --> rp: error
  rp --> v: fix via PR with minimum permission change (never bypass)
else Published
  v -> cc: /plugin install warlog (marketplace scrapup/warlog)
  cc -> mcp: npx -y @scrapup/warlog@0.1.0 mcp
  mcp --> cc: tools/list = registry
  cc -> cc: load skill warlog (operations catalog)
end
@enduml
